[{"title":"谢冯济远惠端砚","author":"李石","text":"学道本屡空，所积岂为贫。\n我生无长物，有辄恐累身。\n挟块公子伯，陶土帝者仁。\n可惜水玉姿，下与瓦砾亲。\n吾子泮林旧，文采含青春。\n江湖挹馀波，谓此席上珍。\n方正自温润，玉德如其人。\n潦倒竟何用，厚德山岳均。\n愧非笔札才，不堪演丝纶。\n三召已三逐，琬琰甘猥尘。\n抆拭置前列，濯以天汉津。\n斯文傥未丧，六经要铺陈。\n大易伏羲祖，春秋丘明臣。\n琢磨三益友，几案增日新。\n定非注虫鱼，与世书凤麟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59425,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢杨寿卿送双鸭用香木拄杖韵","author":"李石","text":"我家群鸡真似木，君家双鸭重如玉。\n情知此物不敢烹，未忍戛羹求剩馥。\n传闻深村水田里，翠羽成群蔽溪谷。\n乔仙两舄不用多，尺纸长须慰幽独。\n墙头瓠壶舍下笋，唤作蒸鹅烹健犊。\n前时馋客错欢喜，益水添薪费煎促。\n主人此外北窗风，饭后乳瓯初睡足。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59426,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢杨寿卿惠香木拄杖","author":"李石","text":"夜郎溪中七香木，长身一握如紫玉。\n向来蛮村已自奇，耻与龙涎斗馀馥。\n誓将膂力奉君子，度越山岩走穷谷。\n夫君得此不自珍，要当助我扶衰独。\n忆昨与君骑竹马，健力随群走黄犊。\n看看四十老形具，此物胡为苦催促。\n世间行险岂吾徒，且卧方舟同结足。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59427,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"感事 其九","author":"李石","text":"近日江西将，常兵已骇闻。\n不知蜂虿陈，敢抗虎貔军。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59428,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"携子孙到四明洞节叙有感","author":"李石","text":"四明本山名，与洞屹相向。\n取山以名洞，足以迎景贶。\n我非济时才，香火三遣放。\n再为玉局吏，圣恩覃旷荡。\n有如鉴湖乞，均逸江海上。\n圆也如乃翁，历历耗心匠。\n三径同蒋诩，五柳比元亮。\n一日培壅力，百年基址壮。\n桃李遵旧蹊，松竹缘叠嶂。\n林花拂朝晴，山鸟激清响。\n园人收果实，夏秋各有饷。\n谁云橐驼种，已有猢孙藏。\n翁前携客来，未免策拄杖。\n崎岖到洞门，衰病筋力彊。\n洞中亦虚白，喜气含万象。\n俎豆具仓猝，一杯复一唱。\n山果与山花，足以备清赏。\n杯盘旨味薄，笔墨醉语妄。\n醉中忽抬眼，云巢仍在望。\n投杯揽衣起，涕泪立惆怅。\n云巢我师友，白玉已黄壤。\n相距洞与山，风雨灯烛晃。\n有如对床夜，了不隔寻丈。\n他日吾子孙，丹青二老像。\n草堂洞山间，二老忽来往。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59429,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"殿柱记","author":"李石","text":"苍龙甲戌岁，修筑周公殿。\n文翁至高君，学校已再变。\n顺考兴平年，寔纪汉之献。\n或云钟会书，入木字隐见。\n自献而至会，朔历斗杓转。\n会初入蜀时，意不止弱禅。\n有如猿猱系，百巧欲伺便。\n杀女不作难，机锋剧刀箭。\n会书固出繇，家法素所善。\n至学艾笔迹，暮夜走邮传。\n老昭岂易欺，真伪猝难辨。\n欺昭尔尚可，蜀士多秀彦。\n当其下笔时，宁不愧颜面。\n虽蒙黼藻文，不掩粪土贱。\n周公傥有灵，白日下雷电。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59430,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蜂蚁","author":"李石","text":"乳蜂十蚁围，小蜂两翼弱。\n三蚁掣蜂首，四蚁曳蜂脚。\n三蚁相后前，捍圉行且却。\n蜂母正凭怒，有虿无敢作。\n相视母子心，如被蛇豕虐。\n蚁行蜂母随，众力岂易拨。\n彼嫌大树小，且幸神龙涸。\n自谓无谁何，利吻得所嚼。\n蝇虎伺其便，儇然才一跃。\n中道取蜂去，意外可遥度。\n蚁群不自量，出力互相搏。\n蝇虎跳掷高，细碎纷迸落。\n馀党尚未解，尺寸归路邈。\n三帅本伐戴，反为郑所掠。\n孟明意取郑，二殽遭晋薄。\n世路蜂蚁群，巇险逞攘攫。\n向来驺虞仁，未似蚁虎恶。\n吾诗傥可佩，捧腹聊一噱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59431,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题三昧泉","author":"李石","text":"乳崖霜雪根，金地白莲蕊。\n泉上碧眼师，秋月照清泚。\n玉奁开明镜，肝胆两冤鬼。\n若为人面创，如以佛手洗。\n遂解七国仇，化为三昧水。\n我来愧尘缨，与世无愧喜。\n平生一瓢心，属餍岂为己。\n定知蜀山龙，云雨高卧里。\n微丝出游戏，僧饭冰入齿。\n灌溉丹穴深，窈窕沧海底。\n人怨旱火焦，雷公费鞭箠。\n请师拄杖头，搅山唤龙起。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59432,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题王氏款竹亭","author":"李石","text":"夏虫不知冰，朝菌不见月。\n吹息天地间，随分了寒热。\n谁为款岁晚，久久媲清节。\n君家小令君，千金僦别业。\n不殊山阴宅，孙子今几叶。\n胜取三百廛，共坐六十劫。\n春林扇温风，夏簟落苍雪。\n重来得更仆，千偈不须说。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59433,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题师永锡知县画老竹枯木二首 其二","author":"李石","text":"水墨三十年，一枝更一节。\n工夫不争多，尽立庭下雪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59434,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题师永锡知县画老竹枯木二首 其一","author":"李石","text":"霜雪倚岩树，雾云秋水槎。\n且须高著眼，上有昙钵花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59435,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题阴山七骑图","author":"李石","text":"回岩客子卖墨人，诸孙卖笔笔有神。\n墨翁已入蓬莱殿，笔孙有愧中书君。\n迩来小孙兼好画，两幅溪藤七匹马。\n虎狼避路狐兔藏，朔风吹沙霜满野。\n邛崃关头大渡河，使君五马千丈坡。\n猎将一围看蛮走，醉敲铜鼓蛮踏歌。\n急收此画人莫识，矍铄之翁誇笔墨。\n不如再泛洞庭船，袖中一剑随飞仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59436,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题李都画枯木","author":"李石","text":"毫端看运斤，笔老木亦老。\n莫画春风枝，秋来厌枯槁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59437,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题苏氏巽风阁","author":"李石","text":"巽风起东南，大地万物小。\n吴门共延瞩，匹练横江表。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59438,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题金马碧鸡神祠","author":"李石","text":"持节使者来自天，玉皇遣问金碧仙。\n蜀山嵯峨九折外，琼楼绛阙迷风烟。\n騑騑蹴踏长楸道，喔喔下鸣芝草田。\n汉家一瑞恐难致，杀人自要身长年。\n麒麟凤凰不知爱，仙物未忍随拘牵。\n至今滇昆水含怒，怒迸海脉浮平川。\n资中男子文章伯，执笔金銮殿中客。\n碧鸡飞去却飞来，此地遂为金马宅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59439,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题黄筌牡丹花下猫","author":"李石","text":"红英艳云霞，绿叶足风雨。\n牡丹花未开，生意妙谁主。\n丹青强摸索，闭目想未睹。\n天巧非人工，神凝志良苦。\n竦然花下猫，蜂喧聒如鼓。\n醉眼不成睡，花气日亭午。\n黄生与我意，盘礴一转语。\n我老花无情，铅粉付儿女。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59440,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题薛公肃问梅图","author":"李石","text":"湖风吹衣筇九节，瘦如梅花骨欲折。\n诗魂别后谁与招，独立西湖树边月。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59441,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黎墨","author":"李石","text":"少休大夫封，应梦上公禄。\n向来岩壑姿，高节媲青竹。\n低徊文绣地，自谓迁进速。\n迩者为客卿，翰苑文史足。\n炎炎虽可鄙，炳炳有足录。\n一朝污浊流，钱券满吾蜀。\n童山要进取，万石压车轴。\n通侯宠富民，都尉侈搜粟。\n虽蒙须臾荣，不盖平生辱。\n社栎乃天全，不及不才木。\n春秋戒求名，吾诗纪山麓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59442,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠开元观李法师","author":"李石","text":"射虎将军须发白，老作三茅洞中客。\n群仙呼去问姓名，谓是前时李八百。\n天孙乞与云锦衣，白日化为仙鹤飞。\n赤城山下百花市，卖符卖药沽酒归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59443,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠张听声","author":"李石","text":"人言鼻听无如龙，听不以耳乃反聋。\n未若水母本无目，隔水响应相鸣雄。\n我持此理问张瞍，废目任耳偏能聪。\n忍闻此声亦愦愦，俗嚣政在群鸣中。\n枉将蚁动作牛斗，妄遣蚊聚成雷公。\n昔人乐归瞽其职，五音六律诗人矇。\n我琴三尺玉横膝，欲广舜孝歌时雍。\n游鱼舞兽解人意，此意忧乐斯民同。\n瞍乎洗耳试一听，莫似北客歌南风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59444,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠杨尉送湫水","author":"李石","text":"天上妥雨水鸣渠，一龙任责固有馀。\n今年水来雨不集，彭民不及江中鱼。\n以堰致水高百尺，灵湫在渊烁红日。\n彭民怨龙不怨人，龙则有职谁之失。\n九峰仙官梅子真，豢龙有术龙不嗔。\n去年作堰今请湫，二者兼得苏彭民。\n东湖别驾但捧腹，卧听萧萧响疏竹。\n往来莫便轻泥涂，软脚有酒为君沽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59445,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠杨教授","author":"李石","text":"读书要身荣，得禄为亲喜。\n端知绛帐华，乃在綵衣里。\n冷官多澹泊，有道足甘旨。\n登堂四壁馀，发帙照案几。\n尚有老孟光，环以三稚子。\n一笑扶鹤发，相见折屐齿。\n出门顾诸生，正事歌锡尔。\n生朝适馀暇，汤饼庆弧矢。\n众客集清辰，好语塞两耳。\n我有海上方，剩泛杯中蚁。\n永为萱堂寿，胜饮菊潭水。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59446,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠墨手道人寄晁子止即用子止韵","author":"李石","text":"夷门道人墨为手，艺如巫咸日中走。\n逢人便与墨模糊，西里自妍东里丑。\n不须更相邑中黔，面比乌鸦色未深。\n为抬墨手高处问，我手何如君子心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59447,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"骤雨","author":"李石","text":"荒风吼其前，大雷击其后。\n人言黄昏雨，此意无乃骤。\n飘飘岂恶声，侧耳听檐溜。\n一睡喜暂凉，破窗落星宿。\n明朝看东方，老火已复昼。\n起行视畦陇，微露泫深秀。\n枯沟涩不流，焦块濡未透。\n看看岁云秋，槁死念谁救。\n滥兴桑羊诛，妄使土龙斗。\n彼巫乃诬尔，拜舞杂符咒。\n举头亦茫茫，万一幸天漏。\n云行则雨施，坎画自羲后。\n为霖有真源，中路困坑窦。\n眼前苍狗姿，津润岂能漱。\n何当捲江海，九万广天覆。\n有祷恐未迟，帝阍吾欲叩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59448,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"瞿唐峡","author":"李石","text":"我行江南上峡来，系舟夜泊云雨台。\n行到西川一万里，杜鹃声急桃花开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59449,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扇子诗 其十九","author":"李石","text":"负笈无他奇货，笔端有力躬耕。\n僰道颇思山谷，兰陵一变荀卿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59450,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扇子诗 其十五","author":"李石","text":"锦煖海棠欲睡，絮浓杨柳初眠。\n蝶老斗高屡舞，莺雏学语如弦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59451,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扇子诗 其三","author":"李石","text":"眼界琉璃鸟度，腹中沆瀣蝉清。\n猗兰羲献父子，瘦竹夷齐弟兄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59452,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扇子诗 其十二","author":"李石","text":"鸡虫日得日失，鹏鴳风高风低。\n天道先看阴骘，人心何忍自欺。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59453,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扇子诗 其十四","author":"李石","text":"师资为学之规，朋友为学之劝。\n说与润屋千金，何似传家万卷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59454,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扇子诗 其十七","author":"李石","text":"颜子见善则迁，子路有过则改。\n懒则鲇鱼上竿，勤则大鹏跨海。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59455,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扇子诗 其八","author":"李石","text":"蜂蜜新房日课，燕泥旧垒年劳。\n睡起香炉圆觉，醉中山芋离骚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59456,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扇子诗 其二十四","author":"李石","text":"涪上拾遗今日，泉声一炷青云。\n会道伤春伤别，世间惟有司勋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59457,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扇子诗 其十三","author":"李石","text":"月波半浸杨柳，谷雨初匀牡丹。\n夜酒只堪欢酌，春罗不耐轻寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59458,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扇子诗 其十八","author":"李石","text":"茶交君子之淡，酒饮圣人之清。\n醉为天下大老，睡则吾辈神兵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59459,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扇子诗 其四","author":"李石","text":"冷著松声似雨，冻教井水成冰。\n猛火烧天烧地，清凉谷里閒僧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59460,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扇子诗 其二十一","author":"李石","text":"柏树庭前度夏，荷花池上经秋。\n若问西来拄杖，何如南去轻舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59461,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扇子诗 其二十","author":"李石","text":"叶叶深云湛碧，花花晴日摇红。\n当是身薰成种，不干秋水香风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59462,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扇子诗 其七","author":"李石","text":"修竿其钓莫钓，短艇似渔非渔。\n欸乃一声山水，杏林夫子琴书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59463,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扇子诗 其五","author":"李石","text":"晴日浅深著柳，暖风高下吹花。\n醉里蝴蝶作梦，醒后狂蜂报衙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59464,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扇子诗 其二十二","author":"李石","text":"风轻匝破世界，山僧如如自在。\n个中纯白团圆，洞然法香水海。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59465,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扇子诗 其六","author":"李石","text":"今古一场梦呓，乾坤六博呼卢。\n醉里猩禽著屐，醒后骊龙忆珠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59466,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扇子诗 其二十六","author":"李石","text":"功德海中游戏，菩提树下清凉。\n只有登山一醉，啸声分付孙郎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59467,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扇子诗 其二十八","author":"李石","text":"三召三逐去之，老眼已不识路。\n偶然得个渔家，此是桃溪西渡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59468,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扇子诗 其二十五","author":"李石","text":"春煖锦棠覆径，夏凉红藕盈池。\n九蕊东篱绽菊，一花南岸梅枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59469,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扇子诗 其一","author":"李石","text":"节节荷风驿置，疏疏竹雨龙悭。\n攲枕几声鼓吹，捲帘数笔湖山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59470,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扇子诗 其三十","author":"李石","text":"达摩一字无法，惠子五车著书。\n透关九重见虎，离钩三寸求鱼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59471,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扇子诗 其十六","author":"李石","text":"冷热衰盾之日，清和夷惠之风。\n天运自有常度，世态人情不同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59472,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扇子诗 其二十九","author":"李石","text":"先睡也须先觉，多文也须多学。\n如此没量大人，不知可畏可藐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59473,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扇子诗 其二十七","author":"李石","text":"竹影千林一族，此中孝子门家。\n释老曾经抱送，诗书便是生涯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59474,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扇子诗 其二十三","author":"李石","text":"隐几今昔两个，卧床左右一边。\n正要脚根著地，莫教火焰烧天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59475,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扇子诗 其二","author":"李石","text":"月树吾人倾盖，风蝉老子闻韶。\n唤起江湖春梦，几番鼓角秋潮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59476,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扇子诗 其九","author":"李石","text":"蕲竹皮肤事业，齐统手腕工夫。\n跳出二乘火宅，直饶一段冰壶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59477,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扇子诗 其十一","author":"李石","text":"东海夜潮舂枕，西湖晓雪窥窗。\n香佩幽兰开国，褐衣明月迷邦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59478,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扇子诗 其十","author":"李石","text":"猛火横秋如烁，银河冷浸月脚。\n三更独立梧桐，不恨夜凉衫薄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59479,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"一剪梅 其一 忆别","author":"李石","text":"红映阑干绿映阶。\n闲闷闲愁，独自徘徊。\n天涯消息几时归，别后无书有梦来。\n后院棠梨昨夜开。\n雨急风忙次第催。\n罗衣消瘦却春寒，莫管红英，一任苍苔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59480,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"一剪梅 其二","author":"李石","text":"百濯香残恨未消。\n万绪千丝，莲藕芭蕉。\n临岐犹自说前时，轻剪乌云解翠翘。\n雨意重来风已飘。\n南陌行人折柳条。\n此间无计可留连，枕上今宵。\n马上明朝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59481,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八声甘州 怀归","author":"李石","text":"向吴天万里、一叶归舟。\n岁月尽悠悠。\n有清歌一曲，醉中自笑，酒醒还愁。\n几度春莺啭午，塞雁横秋。\n渔笛蓑衣底，依旧勾收。\n多谢飞来双鹤，□水边林下，伴我遨游。\n笑老莱晨昏，色笑为亲留。\n有向来、素琴三尺，枕一编、周易在床头。\n君知否，家山梦寐，浑胜瀛洲。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59482,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"卜算子","author":"李石","text":"密叶蜡蜂房，花下频来往。\n不知辛苦为谁甜，山月梅花上。\n玉质紫金衣，香雪随风荡。\n人间唤作返魂梅，仍是蜂儿样。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59483,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乌夜啼 其二","author":"李石","text":"鸾镜愁添眉黛，罗裙瘦减腰肢。\n一回见了一回病，弹指误佳期。\n醉里懵腾泪洗，梦中著摸魂飞。\n一春多少闲风雨，亭院落花时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59484,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乌夜啼 其一","author":"李石","text":"红软榴花脸晕，绿愁杨柳眉疏。\n日长院宇闲消遣，荔子赌樗蒲。\n莹雪凉衣乍浴，裁冰素扇新书。\n绣香熏被梅烟润，枕簟碧纱厨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59485,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乌夜啼 其三 送春","author":"李石","text":"绣阁和烟飞絮，粉墙映日吹红。\n花花柳柳成阴处，休恨五更风。\n絮点铺排绿水，红香收拾黄蜂。\n留春尽道能留得，长在酒杯中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59486,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"木兰花/玉楼春 其二","author":"李石","text":"一春闲却花时候。\n小阁幽窗长独守。\n晴云南浦梦还空，初月西楼眉也皱。\n马嘶何日门前柳。\n脉脉盈盈相见后。\n心头有事不难知，面上看谁真个瘦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59487,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]